{"segment_id": "segment_00001", "start": 30.0, "end": 60.0, "speech": "口语听力训练，对吧？Where were you? 假设你现在是主人公啊。At a village fair. Next one. What did you decide to do there? To visit a fortune teller called Madame Bolinsky. Where did you go? Into her tent. What did she tell you to do? To sit down.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000008.webp", "time": 41.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "What did you decide to do there?", "To visit a fortune-teller called Madam", "Bellinsky."], "scores": [0.99952, 0.99759, 0.99273, 0.99338], "boxes": [[[95.0, 138.0], [462.0, 138.0], [462.0, 198.0], [95.0, 198.0]], [[141.0, 277.0], [926.0, 277.0], [926.0, 342.0], [141.0, 342.0]], [[141.0, 338.0], [997.0, 342.0], [997.0, 400.0], [141.0, 397.0]], [[144.0, 396.0], [365.0, 405.0], [362.0, 469.0], [141.0, 461.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000009.webp", "time": 47.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "Where did you go?"], "scores": [0.99961, 0.9752], "boxes": [[[94.0, 138.0], [463.0, 136.0], [463.0, 195.0], [94.0, 198.0]], [[137.0, 272.0], [597.0, 274.0], [597.0, 351.0], [137.0, 348.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000010.webp", "time": 56.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "What did she tell you to do?"], "scores": [0.9996, 0.9924], "boxes": [[[95.0, 138.0], [463.0, 138.0], [463.0, 198.0], [95.0, 198.0]], [[142.0, 277.0], [796.0, 277.0], [796.0, 342.0], [142.0, 342.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00002", "start": 60.0, "end": 90.0, "speech": "You gave her some money, didn't you? Yes, I did. What did she do then? She looked into a crystal ball. Who did she say was coming to see you? A relation of mine. When would she be arriving? This evening.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000011.webp", "time": 81.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "Who did she say was coming to see you?", "A relation of mine."], "scores": [0.99951, 0.98971, 0.96228], "boxes": [[[95.0, 138.0], [462.0, 138.0], [462.0, 198.0], [95.0, 198.0]], [[138.0, 275.0], [1090.0, 279.0], [1090.0, 349.0], [138.0, 344.0]], [[144.0, 341.0], [575.0, 345.0], [575.0, 400.0], [144.0, 397.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00003", "start": 90.0, "end": 120.0, "speech": "How long did she intend to stay? A few days. She said, \"You'd get a big surprise, didn't she?\" Yes, she did. When would you get a surprise? When I left her tent. Would someone rush towards you? Yes, they would.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000012.webp", "time": 91.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "How long did she intend to stay?"], "scores": [0.99971, 0.96859], "boxes": [[[96.0, 139.0], [461.0, 139.0], [461.0, 196.0], [96.0, 196.0]], [[140.0, 275.0], [904.0, 277.0], [904.0, 346.0], [140.0, 344.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00004", "start": 120.0, "end": 150.0, "speech": "Would it be a man or a woman? A woman. What were you told? She do. She'd speak to me.这个撇地would啊。Where would she lead you? Away from this place. Away from this uh village fair. Asking questions.练习我们能说一般疑", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000013.webp", "time": 121.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Comprehension", "Would it be a man or a woman?"], "scores": [0.99952, 0.97201], "boxes": [[[95.0, 138.0], [463.0, 138.0], [463.0, 198.0], [95.0, 198.0]], [[142.0, 279.0], [879.0, 281.0], [879.0, 340.0], [142.0, 337.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000014.webp", "time": 146.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "训练目标：", "会说一般疑问句＆特殊疑问句", "Accuracy", "Fluency"], "scores": [0.9862, 0.98421, 0.98474, 0.99859, 0.99919], "boxes": [[[90.0, 135.0], [495.0, 138.0], [495.0, 201.0], [90.0, 197.0]], [[146.0, 281.0], [380.0, 281.0], [380.0, 341.0], [146.0, 341.0]], [[146.0, 343.0], [815.0, 343.0], [815.0, 409.0], [146.0, 409.0]], [[31.0, 592.0], [249.0, 602.0], [246.0, 656.0], [28.0, 645.0]], [[638.0, 589.0], [827.0, 601.0], [823.0, 658.0], [634.0, 646.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00005", "start": 150.0, "end": 180.0, "speech": "问句和特殊疑问句的能力。好，我们先看一下，呃例子。I went to a village fair. 变一般疑问句，did提前，动词换回原形。Where？那肯定是village fair了，对吧？Where did you go？啊，那第一个我们不多说了，看第二个。I visited a fortune teller. Did提前，动词换原形。Who对主语和宾语都可以提问，一三均可提问啊。She was called Madame Balinsky.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000015.webp", "time": 152.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "T: Ask me if I went to a village fair."], "scores": [0.99493, 0.93467], "boxes": [[[90.0, 134.0], [495.0, 138.0], [495.0, 202.0], [90.0, 197.0]], [[137.0, 277.0], [953.0, 274.0], [953.0, 349.0], [137.0, 352.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000016.webp", "time": 166.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1.I went to a village fair. (Where)", "2.I visited a fortune-teller. (Who)"], "scores": [0.98921, 0.98057, 0.95647], "boxes": [[[91.0, 133.0], [496.0, 137.0], [495.0, 204.0], [90.0, 199.0]], [[143.0, 277.0], [897.0, 279.0], [897.0, 345.0], [143.0, 343.0]], [[143.0, 355.0], [895.0, 361.0], [895.0, 424.0], [143.0, 418.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000017.webp", "time": 170.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1.I went to a village fair. (Where)", "2.I visited a fortune-teller. (Who)"], "scores": [0.98201, 0.94462, 0.95151], "boxes": [[[90.0, 133.0], [495.0, 137.0], [494.0, 204.0], [89.0, 199.0]], [[143.0, 277.0], [897.0, 279.0], [897.0, 345.0], [143.0, 342.0]], [[143.0, 355.0], [895.0, 361.0], [895.0, 424.0], [143.0, 418.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000018.webp", "time": 173.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1.I went to a village fair. (Where)", "2.I visited a fortune-teller. (Who)"], "scores": [0.98311, 0.96843, 0.95574], "boxes": [[[90.0, 133.0], [496.0, 137.0], [495.0, 204.0], [89.0, 199.0]], [[143.0, 277.0], [897.0, 279.0], [897.0, 345.0], [143.0, 343.0]], [[143.0, 355.0], [895.0, 361.0], [895.0, 424.0], [143.0, 418.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00006", "start": 180.0, "end": 210.0, "speech": "was提前一般过去时的被动，他被叫做。那What就对Madam Belinsky提问，叫What was she called? I went into her tent. Did提前动词换回原形。Where对into her tent提问，Where did you go? She told me to sit down. Did提前对吧？What啊，其实这地方直接给它换成叫What did she tell you? Tell you的是什么呢？To sit down. Ah, who呢？你可以对she提问，也可", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000019.webp", "time": 188.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1.I went to a village fair. (Where)", "2.I visited a fortune-teller. (Who)", "3. She was called Madam Bellinsky. (What)", "4.I went into her tent. (Where)"], "scores": [0.99493, 0.98521, 0.95984, 0.9501, 0.97863], "boxes": [[[91.0, 135.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 202.0], [91.0, 198.0]], [[143.0, 277.0], [896.0, 279.0], [896.0, 345.0], [143.0, 343.0]], [[142.0, 354.0], [896.0, 359.0], [896.0, 425.0], [142.0, 420.0]], [[141.0, 437.0], [1114.0, 442.0], [1114.0, 507.0], [141.0, 502.0]], [[144.0, 519.0], [845.0, 524.0], [845.0, 587.0], [144.0, 582.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
